title CharAI Backend Sequence Diagram

actor Farmer
participant Frontend
participant "Backend API" as API
participant "Auth Service" as Auth
database Database
participant "GeoData Processor" as Geo
participant "Yield Prediction Engine" as Yield
participant "Map Generator" as MapGen
storage "File Storage" as Storage

note over Farmer,API: User creates an account
Farmer->Frontend: Enter registration info
Frontend->API: POST /register (user info)
API->Auth: Validate and create user
Auth->Database: Save user data
Database-->Auth: Success
Auth-->API: Return JWT token
API-->Frontend: Signup success
Frontend-->Farmer: User logged in

note over Farmer,API: User logs in
Farmer->Frontend: Enter credentials
Frontend->API: POST /login
API->Auth: Authenticate user
Auth->Database: Verify credentials
Database-->Auth: Valid
Auth-->API: Return JWT token
API-->Frontend: Login success

note over Farmer,Geo: Manual coordinate entry
Farmer->Frontend: Input coordinates
Frontend->API: POST /land-coordinates
API->Geo: Validate & format coordinates
Geo-->API: Return GeoJSON data
API-->Frontend: Display interactive map

note over Farmer,Geo: Upload land file
Farmer->Frontend: Upload .kml/.geojson file
Frontend->API: POST /upload-land
API->Geo: Extract field boundaries
Geo-->API: Return GeoJSON data
API-->Frontend: Display uploaded area

note over Farmer,Yield: Generate prescription map
Farmer->Frontend: Click "Generate Map"
Frontend->API: POST /generate-map (coordinates)
API->Yield: Send field, soil, slope, moisture, etc.
Yield->Yield: Run model with biochar adjustment
Yield-->API: Return ROI prediction data
API->MapGen: Generate color-coded prescription map
MapGen->Storage: Save map file
Storage-->MapGen: File URL
MapGen-->API: Map generated successfully
API->Database: Save map metadata (URL, date)
Database-->API: Stored
API-->Frontend: Send map + download link
Frontend-->Farmer: Show result map

note over Farmer,Storage: Download map
Farmer->Frontend: Click "Download Map"
Frontend->API: GET /download-map/{id}
API->Storage: Fetch map file
Storage-->API: Return file stream
API-->Frontend: Send file
Frontend-->Farmer: Download map